it soars to great heights.",[25]="Wingull has the habit of carrying prey and valuables in its beak and hiding them in all sorts of locations. This Pokémon rides the winds and flies as if it were skating across the sky.",[26]="Wingull rides updrafts rising from the sea by extending its long and narrow wings to glide. This Pokémon’s long beak is useful for catching prey.",[27]="Its hollow bones enhance its lightness. It spreads its wings to the wind and soars away into the sky.",[28]="Fishermen keep an eye out for Wingull in the sky, because wherever they’re circling, the ocean is sure to be teeming with fish Pokémon.",[29]="With its long, thin wings, it catches updrafts and flies like a glider high up into the sky.",[30]="It builds nests in cliffs by the sea. It circles the skies above the ocean looking for its favorite food, Wishiwashi.",[33]="It makes its nest on sheer cliffs. Riding the sea breeze, it glides up into the expansive skies.",[34]="It soars on updrafts without flapping its wings. It makes a nest on sheer cliffs at the sea’s edge."},es={[23]="Sus largas alas aprovechan los vientos marinos para planear. Cuando descansa, las pliega.",[24]="Anida en acantilados y alcanza gran altura aprovechando las corrientes ascendentes.",[25]="Wingull tiene la costumbre de llevar a su presa y objetos de valor en el pico, y esconderlos en distintos sitios. Este Pokémon vuela dejándose llevar por las corrientes de aire como si fuera patinando por el cielo.",[26]="Wingull emerge del mar y asciende desplegando las largas y estrechas alas que posee. Este Pokémon tiene un pico largo que le resulta muy útil para pescar.",[27]="Sus huesos livianos y sus grandes alas le permiten dejarse llevar por el viento y surcar los cielos grácilmente.",[28]="Suele sobrevolar los bancos de Pokémon pez, por lo que los pescadores siguen a Wingull cuando buscan buenas capturas.",[29]="Tiene alas largas y finas. Se deja llevar por las corrientes ascendentes y luego planea a alta cota grácilmente.",[30]="Anida en los riscos junto a la costa y sobrevuela el mar trazando círculos en busca de algún Wishiwashi que llevarse al buche.",[33]="Construye sus nidos en acantilados escarpados. Aprovecha la brisa marina para elevarse hacia el inmenso cielo y planear.",[34]="Aprovecha las corrientes de aire para ganar altura sin necesidad de batir las alas. Anida en acantilados costeros."},pt="Plana nas correntes de ar ascendentes sem bater as asas. Faz o ninho em penhascos íngremes à beira-mar."},evo={{s=278},{s=279,from=278,c={{t="level-up",lv=25}}}},moves={[5]={1,45,1,55,7,48,13,17,21,54,31,98,43,228,55,97},[6]={1,45,1,55,7,48,13,17,21,54,31,98,43,228,55,97},[7]={1,45,1,55,7,48,13,17,21,54,31,98,43,228,55,97},[8]={1,45,1,55,6,48,11,17,16,54,19,352,24,98,29,355,34,228,37,97,42,332,47,403},[9]={1,45,1,55,6,48,11,17,16,54,19,352,24,98,29,355,34,228,37,97,42,332,47,403},[10]={1,45,1,55,6,48,11,17,16,54,19,352,24,98,29,355,34,228,37,97,42,332,47,403},[11]={1,45,1,55,6,48,11,17,16,54,19,352,24,98,29,355,34,228,37,97,42,332,47,403,50,542},[12]={1,45,1,55,7,48,13,17,21,54,31,98,43,228,55,97},[13]={1,45,1,55,7,48,13,17,21,54,31,98,43,228,55,97},[14]={1,45,1,55,6,48,9,17,14,54,17,352,22,98,26,355,30,228,33,314,38,97,42,332,46,403,49,542},[15]={1,45,1,55,6,48,9,17,14,54,17,352,22,98,26,355,30,228,33,314,38,97,42,332,46,403,49,542},[16]={1,45,1,55,5,48,8,17,12,54,15,352,19,98,22,314,26,228,29,332,33,355,36,97,40,403,43,542},[17]={1,45,1,55,5,48,8,17,12,54,15,352,19,98,22,314,26,228,29,332,33,355,36,97,40,403,43,542},[18]={1,45,1,55,5,48,8,17,12,54,15,352,19,98,22,314,26,228,29,332,33,355,36,97,40,403,43,542},[20]={1,45,1,55,5,98,10,48,15,17,20,352,26,97,30,403,35,54,40,355,45,542},[23]={1,45,1,55,5,98,10,48,15,17,20,352,26,97,30,403,35,54,40,355,45,542},[25]={1,45,1,55,5,98,10,48,15,17,20,352,26,97,30,403,35,54,40,355,45,542}},enc={[12]={1,5,20,30,30,3,5,20,30,30,8,5,20,30,30,10,1,29,29,10,10,5,20,30,30,119,5,20,30,30,146,5,20,30,30,163,1,20,20,10,163,5,20,30,30,168,1,29,29,10,16